1
00:00:00,303 --> 00:00:04,533
(Howard:)Come on, she came back.
This is good news. You should celebrate.

2
00:00:04,707 --> 00:00:06,607
(Raj:)I don't want to celebrate.

3
00:00:12,382 --> 00:00:13,612
(Howard:)Not even a little?

4
00:00:13,783 --> 00:00:16,943
(Howard:)We could have a pants party.
Go put some on.

5
00:00:18,021 --> 00:00:21,181
(Raj:)Why would I want her number?
I want nothing to do with this woman.

6
00:00:21,357 --> 00:00:22,947
(Howard:)- Come on, Raj.
- You don't get it.

7
00:00:23,126 --> 00:00:25,356
(Raj:)I want nothing to do with any woman.

8
00:00:25,528 --> 00:00:27,398
(Raj:)My heart is stone.

9
00:00:29,098 --> 00:00:30,798
From now on, I am a monk.

10
00:00:30,967 --> 00:00:33,667
(Raj:)I renounce all worldly pleasures.

11
00:00:34,003 --> 00:00:35,163
(Raj:)Except for lobster.

12
00:00:36,973 --> 00:00:38,843
(Raj:)And garlic butter.

13
00:00:40,009 --> 00:00:43,669
Boy, I wanna tell you it's her loss,
but you are not making it easy.

14
00:00:45,849 --> 00:00:50,619
(Raj:)You're a good friend for trying to help,
but I've made my choice.

15
00:00:51,921 --> 00:00:54,021
(Howard:)All right, well...

